# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Backend-specific ignores. Dependencies, dist/, .env and editor cruft are
# already covered by the repository-root .gitignore.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Member-uploaded files are user data, not source. The directory itself must
# survive a fresh clone, so the .gitkeep placeholder stays tracked — the
# UPLOAD_STORAGE_PATH default (./uploads) expects it to exist.
uploads/*
!uploads/.gitkeep

# Prisma generates the client into node_modules; nothing else here is generated.
# The schema and the migrations under database/prisma/migrations/ are source and
# are intentionally NOT ignored.
